# Maz Works Knowledge Vault

This is Manazir Hussain's shared knowledge system for Maz Works projects, client work, research, experiments, and agent handoffs.

## Work from shared truth

- Read the relevant `wiki/projects/{project}/` context first.
- Use `wiki/hot.md` for recent cross-project context.
- Treat `.raw/` as immutable source material.
- Use Obsidian wikilinks for internal knowledge links.
- Keep `wiki/log.md` append-only and refresh `wiki/hot.md` at session end.
- Read a selected skill's complete `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` before applying it.
- Never store credentials, private client information, or private spiritual content.

The canonical repository is <https://github.com/manazoid4/maz-works-knowledge-vault>. Upstream provenance is documented in `ATTRIBUTION.md`.
